message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and software artifact as below."
title: "Epistemic Ecology Runtime (EER)"
abstract: >-
  A high-performance Python/Numba numerical framework implementing a strictly
  convex variational solver for belief aggregation on directed epistemic graphs,
  with SCC consensus, cascade and cycle regularization, and bounded-delay
  asynchronous scheduling.
